backend/google-credentials.json

# --- self-host (WP0): slim down the monorepo build context ---
# NB: do NOT exclude backend/, .github/scripts/, firestore.rules, firestore.indexes.json,
# deploy/onprem/ — they are copied by the Dockerfiles (backend + emulator).
# NB: do NOT exclude plugins/ OR web/ — this root .dockerignore applies to EVERY build from the repo
# root, and the plugins production image (.github/workflows/gcp_plugins.yml: `docker build -f
# plugins/Dockerfile .`) COPYs plugins/ from that root context; likewise web/frontend/Dockerfile and
# web/app/Dockerfile build from the ROOT context and `COPY web/frontend/... web/app/...`, so excluding
# web/ empties those COPYs and breaks the web images (cubic PR 10887 .dockerignore:15).
.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
app/
omiGlass/
desktop/
sdks/
mcp/
omi/firmware/
